---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";

const affiliateEnabled = Boolean(import.meta.env.PUBLIC_AMAZON_ASSOCIATE_TAG);
---

<Base
  title="Affiliate disclosure"
  description="How affiliate links and product recommendations work on vishvaddi.com."
>
  <h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1>
  <p>
    Product lists are curated for usefulness and relevance. A product is not included
    solely because it offers a commission.
  </p>

  {affiliateEnabled ? (
    <p><strong>As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases.</strong></p>
  ) : (
    <p>Amazon links currently use no affiliate tracking tag.</p>
  )}

  <p>
    When affiliate tracking is active, a purchase made after following a marked link
    may earn this site a commission at no additional cost to you. Affiliate links are
    marked with <code>rel="sponsored"</code> and disclosed on the relevant page.
  </p>

  <p>
    Prices and availability change. The site links to Amazon AU searches rather than
    presenting prices as current facts.
  </p>
</Base>
